! This test calculates the spin-orbit components of the 2P state of Fluorine,
! using a CISD wavefunction.
! 
! Three different classes of Hamiltonians are used: the four-comonent Dirac-Coulomb (DC),
! the two-component Hamiltonians (BSS,DKH2..) and mean-field screened two-component
! Hamiltonians.
!
!  1 au = 219474.6313710 cm-1
!
!  Hamiltonian     The calculated splittings(in cm-1)
! ==========================================================
!       DC                45.42
!    BSS+MFSSO            47.52
!  BSS_RKB+MFSSO          47.52
!  BSSsfESO1+MFSSO        47.59
!  DKH2sfESO1+MFSSO       47.59
!      BSS               192.83
!     BSS_RKB            192.83
!     BSSsfESO1          192.91
!     BSSsfBSO1          192.91
!     DKH2sfESO1         192.91
!     DKH2sfBSO1         192.91
